# Plugin: Verification Before Completion Adapter

Purpose:
  Adapt Superpowers verification-before-completion skill for SDDRA R1 arm.

Source:
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\{project_name}\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\verification-before-completion\SKILL.md

Original:
  Ensure work is actually done before claiming completion
  Check against original requirements

Adapted for SDDRA:
  Verification checklist for R1 arm:
    1. All tests pass
    2. Linter passes
    3. Decision requirements met
    4. Security review passed (if required)
    5. Documentation updated
    6. No drift from .sdd/project/

  Decision verification:
    - All decision criteria met
    - All decision tasks completed
    - Decision status updated to verified

  Integration:
    - R1 arm uses this checklist
    - Verification recorded in decisions/
    - Drift detection from .sdd to project/

Usage:
  Referenced by:
    .sdd/chains/arms/review.sdd
    .sdd/chains/rules/chain-rules.sdd (CR6)

  Triggers:
    - C1 arm completes
    - R1 arm execution
    - Before marking task complete

State: Adapted
